When the user asks for ads, creatives, hooks, UGC, TikTok/Meta/YouTube spots,
launch films, storyboards, or “make ads that don’t look like AI slop”:

1. Use the **ad-intelligence** skill (`.cursor/skills/ad-intelligence` → `SKILL.md`).
2. `node skills/ad-intelligence/scripts/probe-harness.mjs` → fill tool card → choose rung.
3. URL/site → `brief-from-url.mjs`. Then one-shot: attention model → Concept → dense beats → craft → lint.
4. Run start-package → retrieve `--compact` → Attention Lab → lint until ok.
5. Equalize missing MCP (handoff/assembler) — never invent job ids or lint JSON.
